{"id":"actuacio_n","lemma":"actuación","pos":"noun","rank":1883,"glosses":["performance (a live show or concert)","acting (the occupation of an actor)","action (something done to accomplish a purpose)"],"ipa":"/aɡtwaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"actuaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-actuaci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuándo acaba la actuación?","en":"When does the performance end?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to finish","l":"acabar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La actuación no fue genial.","en":"The acting wasn't great.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"great, very good"}]},{"text":"Fue una actuación terrible.","en":"It was an awful performance.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"terrible"}]},{"text":"Su actuación fue asombrosa.","en":"His performance was amazing.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"amazing","l":"asombroso"}]},{"text":"¡Que actuación tan extraordinaria!","en":"What a remarkable performance!","words":[{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"so, as"},{"g":"extraordinary","l":"extraordinario"}]}]}